      ],
      "source": "https://www.watsonville.gov/440/Local-History"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The library digitized its Shades of Watsonville photo collection in 2019 through California Revealed, a state library project.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.watsonville.gov/440/Local-History"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The virtual exhibit Shades of Watsonville, supported by partners like the Tobera Project and the Filipino Community Center, lets visitors explore the city’s diverse history online.",
